00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:15.850
 Leo was there and the lady comes in and she's irate, you know, that there's this bottle of Pepsi,

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:25.420
 um, in this picture, you know, um, and, and she says like, you know, basically like you indigenous

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:31.520
 people know that Pepsi is ruining the world, right? It's ruining your teeth. It's, you know,

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:35.660
 it's contaminating all the water and I can't believe you would support something like this,

