 you know? And, and Leo's response was, well, you know, that was an editorial choice by me to leave

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:49.260
 in that bottle of Pepsi. My cousins had come from the coast. We were all having a meal together.

00:22:49.520 --> 00:22:54.840
 If you look at everything else on the table, it's all handmade, you know, most of it's grown by my

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:01.790
 aunts and uncles and we were celebrating, right? So we had our whole thing and we had our Pepsi and it

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:08.140
 made the meal all together. So I think that she really talks about what you're talking about with

00:23:08.140 --> 00:23:15.540
 this like complex set of relationships that make up this ability to save her life, right? That's

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:24.790
 relational, that doesn't exist outside of globalization and change, but it also exists deeply in a traditional

