00:28:15.330 --> 00:28:20.880
 There has to be kind of a, I don't know, a pluralistic look at this, that's happening in

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:26.790
 all these different ways. But could you talk about one of those ways that I really see coming up over

00:28:26.790 --> 00:28:37.140
 and over is, um, is generosity in your book and, um, people, I mean, maybe it's the questions you ask,

00:28:37.200 --> 00:28:41.760
 maybe it's the way you showed up. I'm not exactly sure what happened, but I was really struck by

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:47.750
 how much generosity people showed you and how you think that plays a role.

00:28:49.010 --> 00:28:57.050
 Gosh, that's so beautiful. Thank you. Um, they did, they did. And I think it was the combination

