 of several things. Um, first they are generous and good. And, um, what this journey did was restore

00:29:08.730 --> 00:29:15.900
 my faith in humanity and, um, the generosity that was extended to me by people who had so little,

00:29:15.900 --> 00:29:20.880
 I mean, this almost sounds like, you know, whatever. Um, so we're played or like, Oh,

00:29:20.940 --> 00:29:25.740
 I went to the like poor place and everyone was so rich in there, you know, giving to me, but it's

