00:33:43.750 --> 00:33:53.530
 questions. And how do you see your role as a storyteller in this? Um, I see my role, you know,

00:33:53.670 --> 00:33:59.310
 so funny, like, uh, Vanity Fair magazine did a green issue. They did a couple of them and I wanted

