00:34:35.340 --> 00:34:40.430
 I mean that in the depth of research, you know, I'm a scientist daughter. Uh, we immigrate

00:34:40.430 --> 00:34:45.880
 here, my family through national institutes of health, you know, uh, sponsoring my father,

00:34:46.080 --> 00:34:50.930
 you know, he was a cancer researcher who became a psychiatrist and I'm never going to give you

00:34:50.930 --> 00:34:58.830
 like weak data. Um, but I also believe in the construct of the heart and, um, I'm never going

00:34:58.830 --> 00:35:06.930
 to shy away from my ownership of this care because what I have found in that kind of sterile environmental

00:35:06.930 --> 00:35:13.890
